\'93Oh, yeah. How many Quaaludes have you had today?\'94\
Jude the record producer flipped a switch on the console and leant towards a mic. \'93Hey, fellas, let\'92s none of us start accusing anyone of having a drug problem. Take a break.\'94\
Rusty and Pacer eyed each other and relaxed. The other Elvi released them, until Rusty sang, \'93Take a bad song and shove it up your ass.\'94\
\
