The room grew quieter as more Elvi pulled out their tablets and browsed. Even the Elvisettes put aside their fandom and consulted their screens. A cluster of them huddled around a single tablet, pointing at the display.\
\'93Whoa\'85\'94 said an Elvis as if his grass-ignored mind was being mown. \'93
