Chanta rather saw it was the Airborne who had made their religion exactly the way they wanted. \'93\'91Perfection of the market\'92, my perfect ball-sack. It\'92s perfect self-interest, is what it is.\'94\
\'93We must heed the word of the One,\'94 Vince said, standing to quick attention and toppling over his sundae. \'93We must reject religion and heed the words of the Warranty.\'94\
